
========================================================================
  REFUSED TO SCORE — FCF MODEL INAPPLICABLE (financials)
========================================================================

FMP sector='Financial Services' industry='Banks - Diversified' classifies as bank — banks, insurers and diversified financials have no meaningful free-cash-flow reading: operating cash flow is dominated by balance-sheet financing and capex is immaterial, so `ocf - capex` computes cleanly and measures nothing. RULED A CLASS by Vic 2026-08-28; not a coverage gap and not fixable with better inputs.

Typed reason: fcf:model_inapplicable:financials

Nothing numeric was computed and NOTHING was written: no pillars, no E(R),
no lifecycle stage, no evaluation row. The stored flag row in `fundamental_series`
is the record.

Financials are UNSCOREABLE pending a dedicated leg — the router and the gate are
shipped, the engine is not built. Ruled by Vic 2026-08-28.
